    "description": "<p>The Dragon-Blood channels the elemental wrath of her aspect into a sweeping gesture, visibly reshaping the battlefield with Shaping power. This Charm may be used reflexively when a unit the Exalt commands successfully attacks an enemy unit. The anima of the Exalt blazes forth (Obvious) and shapes the terrain or elemental conditions in a zone up to (Essence × 25) yards across in any direction the Exalt gestures. The shaped zone imposes a −2 internal penalty on all actions by enemies who must enter or pass through it until the end of the current scene. Dragon-Blooded allies of the Exalt's aspect are immune to this penalty.</p>",
